From 488a1ce9d670e4b8a267fd9d47888b9db67b37c6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: qa-p1 <tutejaharneet@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 06:02:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Connected apps and slot actions for Arcade Find

Find now has a Link service (Arcade-Find feature/find-v0.1). The
compatibility metadata becomes AppMetadata (Shelf and Find) beside the
frozen vendored Link module:

- Find appears in Connected apps with its name, pitch, glyph, accent
  (#22C55E) and Get link, and can be switched off per peer.
- Slots can hold Find's actions (find.show with clipboard text or a
  file selection opens Find on it).
- Tests: Connected apps lists seven apps with Find's glyph; find.show drafts
  keep their input mode.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MGVuwj5qJec99PTCt3AbkN
